{"sha": "213362a0e3e94704bd64b0e0104c117bac0cd481e0db21b12233a342f52e46b2", "body": ["\\begin{example}[若干初值与一个著名恒等式]\\label{ex:b1:complex:eulerid}", "在几个特殊角上直接由定义读出：", "\\[", "\\eu^{\\iu\\pi/2} = \\iu, \\qquad", "\\eu^{\\iu\\pi} = -1, \\qquad", "\\eu^{2\\iu\\pi} = 1, \\qquad", "\\eu^{\\iu\\pi/4} = \\frac{\\sqrt2}2\\,(1 + \\iu) .", "\\]", "第二个式子移项得 $\\eu^{\\iu\\pi} + 1 = 0$，即为欧拉", "著名的恒等式，它联系了 $\\eu$、$\\iu$、$\\pi$、$1$ 与 $0$。", "在本阶段它只是定义的直接展开，而非定理，其真正含义 ---", "为何将 \\cref{ch:b1:functions} 中的解析指数函数", "推广到虚变量后仍沿用同一名称 --- 由\\cref{ch:b1:series}", "中的幂级数予以确定。", "与此同时，上面的式子", "值得熟记，将它当作一张换算表使用，", "每当从图上读取辐角时都会默默用到它。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[函数方程]\\label{thm:b1:complex:funceq}", "对所有 $\\theta, \\varphi \\in \\R$：", "\\[", "\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}\\, \\eu^{\\iu\\varphi} = \\eu^{\\iu(\\theta + \\varphi)},", "\\qquad", "\\abs{\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}} = 1,", "\\qquad", "\\conj{\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}} = \\eu^{-\\iu\\theta} = (\\eu^{\\iu\\theta})^{-1}.", "\\]", "由此，$\\abs{zw} = \\abs z \\abs w$ 对辐角同样成立，即", "$\\arg(zw) \\equiv \\arg z + \\arg w \\pmod{2\\pi}$.", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "展开乘积，并利用加法公式：", "\\[", "(\\cos\\theta + \\iu\\sin\\theta)(\\cos\\varphi + \\iu\\sin\\varphi)", "= (\\cos\\theta\\cos\\varphi - \\sin\\theta\\sin\\varphi)", "+ \\iu\\,(\\sin\\theta\\cos\\varphi + \\cos\\theta\\sin\\varphi),", "\\]", "即 $\\cos(\\theta+\\varphi) + \\iu\\sin(\\theta+\\varphi)$。模", "为 $\\sqrt{\\cos^2\\theta + \\sin^2\\theta} = 1$，共轭公式", "由余弦与正弦的奇偶性得到，它是 $\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}$ 的逆，", "因为 $\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}\\eu^{-\\iu\\theta} = \\eu^0 = 1$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{corollary}[棣莫弗公式]\\label{cor:b1:complex:demoivre}", "对 $\\theta \\in \\R$ 与 $n \\in \\Z$：", "$\\;(\\cos\\theta + \\iu\\sin\\theta)^n = \\cos(n\\theta) +", "\\iu\\sin(n\\theta)$。\\index{棣莫弗公式}", "\\end{corollary}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "当 $n \\geq 0$ 时用归纳法。$n = 0$ 时为 $1 = 1$。假设", "公式对 $n$ 成立，由函数方程", "（\\cref{thm:b1:complex:funceq}）可得", "\\[", "\\bigl(\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}\\bigr)^{n+1}", "= \\bigl(\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}\\bigr)^{n}\\,\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}", "= \\eu^{\\iu n\\theta}\\,\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}", "= \\eu^{\\iu(n+1)\\theta} ,", "\\]", "即为 $n + 1$ 时的公式。对 $n < 0$，记 $n = -m$", "其中 $m > 0$：由于 $\\eu^{\\iu m\\theta}$ 的逆为", "$\\eu^{-\\iu m\\theta}$（再由 \\cref{thm:b1:complex:funceq}）：", "\\[", "\\bigl(\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}\\bigr)^{-m}", "= \\bigl(\\eu^{\\iu m\\theta}\\bigr)^{-1}", "= \\eu^{\\iu(-m)\\theta} . \\qedhere", "\\]", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[用棣莫弗公式展开 $\\cos 3\\theta$]\\label{ex:b1:complex:cos3}", "记 $c = \\cos\\theta$，$s = \\sin\\theta$。由棣莫弗公式与二项式", "定理可得", "\\[", "\\cos 3\\theta + \\iu \\sin 3\\theta = (c + \\iu s)^3", "= c^3 - 3cs^2 + \\iu\\,(3c^2 s - s^3),", "\\]", "比较实部，再代入 $s^2 = 1 - c^2$：", "\\[", "\\cos 3\\theta = c^3 - 3c(1 - c^2) = 4\\cos^3\\theta - 3\\cos\\theta .", "\\]", "虚部顺带给出 $\\sin 3\\theta = 3\\sin\\theta -", "4\\sin^3\\theta$。一个复恒等式总带有", "\\emph{两个}实恒等式。反过来读，上面的恒等式是", "经典三等分方程的关键：", "构造 $\\cos(\\theta/3)$（从 $\\cos\\theta$ 出发）等价于求解三次方程 $4x^3 -", "3x = \\cos\\theta$，这正是", "在\\cref{ch:b1:poly}中的代数理论接手之处。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[欧拉公式]\\label{prop:b1:complex:euler}", "\\[", "\\cos\\theta = \\frac{\\eu^{\\iu\\theta} + \\eu^{-\\iu\\theta}}{2},", "\\qquad", "\\sin\\theta = \\frac{\\eu^{\\iu\\theta} - \\eu^{-\\iu\\theta}}{2\\iu}.", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "将 $\\eu^{\\iu\\theta} = \\cos\\theta +", "\\iu\\sin\\theta$ 与 $\\eu^{-\\iu\\theta} = \\cos\\theta - \\iu\\sin\\theta$ 分别相加、相减。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[用指数函数处理三角]\\label{met:b1:complex:trig}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item \\emph{线性化} $\\cos^p\\theta \\sin^q\\theta$（把幂化为", "        $\\cos k\\theta$、$\\sin k\\theta$ 的和）：代入欧拉", "        公式，用二项式定理展开", "        （\\cref{thm:b1:counting:binomial}），再合并共轭项。", "  \\item \\emph{展开} $\\cos n\\theta$，写成 $\\cos\\theta$ 的多项式：", "        记 $\\cos n\\theta = \\Re\\bigl((\\cos\\theta +", "        \\iu\\sin\\theta)^n\\bigr)$，展开后将", "        偶次幂的 $\\sin$ 借助 $\\sin^2 = 1 - \\cos^2$ 化去。", "  \\item \\emph{三角级数求和}，如 $\\sum_k \\cos k\\theta$：", "        识别几何和 $\\sum_k", "        (\\eu^{\\iu\\theta})^k$ 的实部。", "  \\item \\emph{半角因式分解}：对所有 $p, q$，", "        \\[", "        \\eu^{\\iu p} + \\eu^{\\iu q}", "        = 2 \\cos\\tfrac{p - q}{2}\\; \\eu^{\\iu \\frac{p+q}{2}},", "        \\qquad", "        \\eu^{\\iu p} - \\eu^{\\iu q}", "        = 2\\iu \\sin\\tfrac{p - q}{2}\\; \\eu^{\\iu \\frac{p+q}{2}} .", "        \\]", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", ""]}